        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>NIST SP 800-82r3 - Guide to Operational Technology (OT) Security - Page 248</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Times New Roman\", Times, serif;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    color: #000;\n    max-width: 1000px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 40px 60px;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n  }\n  .header {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    margin-bottom: 30px;\n  }\n  .header .left, .header .right {\n    line-height: 1.4;\n  }\n  .section-title {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    margin-top: 25px;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n    letter-spacing: 0.3px;\n  }\n  p {\n    margin: 0 0 12px 0;\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n  table {\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    width: 100%;\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n  }\n  table, th, td {\n    border: 1px solid #000;\n  }\n  th, td {\n    padding: 6px 10px;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  th {\n    background-color: #d9d9d9;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .cntl-col {\n    text-align: center;\n    width: 12%;\n  }\n  .control-name-col {\n    text-align: left;\n    width: 46%;\n  }\n  .baseline-header {\n    background-color: #d9d9d9;\n  }\n  .control-row td {\n    background-color: #f0f0f0;\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n  .control-row td:first-child, .control-row td:nth-child(3), .control-row td:nth-child(4), .control-row td:nth-child(5) {\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .control-row td:first-child {\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n  .enh-name {\n    font-style: italic;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    text-align: left;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n  .enh-row td:first-child {\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n  .discussion {\n    margin-top: 10px;\n  }\n  .underline {\n    text-decoration: underline;\n  }\n  .page-number {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-top: 40px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"header\">\n  <div class=\"left\">NIST SP 800-82r3<br>September 2023</div>\n  <div class=\"right\">Guide to Operational Technology (OT) Security</div>\n</div>\n\n<p>be possible. When the organization cannot provide necessary essential services, support, or automated mechanisms during contingency operations, it should provide nonautomated mechanisms or predetermined procedures as compensating controls in accordance with the general tailoring guidance. Examples of compensating controls are given with each control as appropriate.</p>\n\n<div class=\"section-title\">CP-1&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;POLICY AND PROCEDURES</div>\n\n<table>\n  <colgroup>\n    <col style=\"width:12%\">\n    <col style=\"width:46%\">\n    <col style=\"width:14%\">\n    <col style=\"width:14%\">\n    <col style=\"width:14%\">\n  </colgroup>\n  <tr>\n    <th rowspan=\"2\">CNTL<br>NO.</th>\n    <th>CONTROL NAME<br><span style=\"font-style:italic; font-weight:normal;\">Control Enhancement Name</span></th>\n    <th colspan=\"3\">CONTROL BASELINES</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th>LOW</th>\n    <th>MOD</th>\n    <th>HIGH</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr class=\"control-row\">\n    <td>CP-1</td>\n    <td><strong>Policy and Procedures</strong></td>\n    <td>Select</td>\n    <td>Select</td>\n    <td>Select</td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n<p><span class=\"underline\">OT Discussion:</span> The policy specifically addresses the unique properties and requirements of OT and the relationship to non-OT systems.</p>\n\n<div class=\"section-title\">CP-2&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CONTINGENCY PLAN</div>\n\n<table>\n  <colgroup>\n    <col style=\"width:12%\">\n    <col style=\"width:46%\">\n    <col style=\"width:14%\">\n    <col style=\"width:14%\">\n    <col style=\"width:14%\">\n  </colgroup>\n  <tr>\n    <th rowspan=\"2\">CNTL<br>NO.</th>\n    <th>CONTROL NAME<br><span style=\"font-style:italic; font-weight:normal;\">Control Enhancement Name</span></th>\n    <th colspan=\"3\">CONTROL BASELINES</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th>LOW</th>\n    <th>MOD</th>\n    <th>HIGH</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr class=\"control-row\">\n    <td>CP-2</td>\n    <td><strong>Contingency Plan</strong></td>\n    <td>Select</td>\n    <td>Select</td>\n    <td>Select</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr class=\"enh-row\">\n    <td>CP-2 (1)</td>\n    <td class=\"enh-name\">Contingency Plan | Coordinate with Related Plans</td>\n    <td></td>\n    <td>Select</td>\n    <td>Select</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr class=\"enh-row\">\n    <td>CP-2 (2)</td>\n    <td class=\"enh-name\">Contingency Plan | Capacity Planning</td>\n    <td></td>\n    <td></td>\n    <td>Select</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr class=\"enh-row\">\n    <td>CP-2 (3)</td>\n    <td class=\"enh-name\">Contingency Plan | Resume Mission and Business Functions</td>\n    <td></td>\n    <td>Select</td>\n    <td>Select</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr class=\"enh-row\">\n    <td>CP-2 (5)</td>\n    <td class=\"enh-name\">Contingency Plan | Continue Mission and Business Functions</td>\n    <td></td>\n    <td></td>\n    <td>Select</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr class=\"enh-row\">\n    <td>CP-2 (8)</td>\n    <td class=\"enh-name\">Contingency Plan | Identify Critical Assets</td>\n    <td></td>\n    <td>Select</td>\n    <td>Select</td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n<p><span class=\"underline\">OT Discussion:</span> The organization defines contingency plans for categories of disruptions or failures. In the case of a contingency, the OT equipment executes preprogrammed functions, such as alerting the operator of the failure and then doing nothing, alerting the operator and then safely shutting down the industrial process, or alerting the operator and then maintaining the last operational setting prior to failure. Contingency plans for widespread disruption may involve specialized organizations (e.g., FEMA, emergency services, regulatory authorities).</p>\n\n<p><span class=\"underline\">Control Enhancement:</span> (1) (2) (3) (5) (8) No OT Discussion for this control.</p>\n\n<div class=\"section-title\">CP-3&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CONTINGENCY TRAINING</div>\n\n<table>\n  <colgroup>\n    <col style=\"width:12%\">\n    <col style=\"width:46%\">\n    <col style=\"width:14%\">\n    <col style=\"width:14%\">\n    <col style=\"width:14%\">\n  </colgroup>\n  <tr>\n    <th rowspan=\"2\">CNTL<br>NO.</th>\n    <th>CONTROL NAME<br><span style=\"font-style:italic; font-weight:normal;\">Control Enhancement Name</span></th>\n    <th colspan=\"3\">CONTROL BASELINES</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th>LOW</th>\n    <th>MOD</th>\n    <th>HIGH</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr class=\"control-row\">\n    <td>CP-3</td>\n    <td><strong>Contingency Training</strong></td>\n    <td>Select</td>\n    <td>Select</td>\n    <td>Select</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr class=\"enh-row\">\n    <td>CP-3 (1)</td>\n    <td class=\"enh-name\">Contingency Training | Simulated Events</td>\n    <td></td>\n    <td></td>\n    <td>Select</td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n<p>No OT Discussion for this control.</p>\n\n<div class=\"page-number\">248</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
